59
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:34,606
Now the core of advanced challenge A02 — intelligent decisions and optimization. We

60
00:04:34,656 --> 00:04:39,233
add demand for the failed asset and let OR-Tools CP-SAT allocate it: variables are

61
00:04:39,283 --> 00:04:43,860
