65
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:02,759
It never guesses — and nothing is approved until a human decides.

66
00:05:05,210 --> 00:05:09,495
An honest solver must also be able to say no. We add two mandatory priority-one

67
00:05:09,545 --> 00:05:13,829
