70
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:28,050
Persisted, the plan page states exactly why nothing can be approved — and no

71
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:32,290
allocation is invented. The safe correction is constraint relief: we re-solve the

72
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:36,530
same demands without the artificial overload, and the solver recovers a full

73
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:40,770
