87
00:06:52,170 --> 00:06:56,290
The approval gate is the point: nothing advances until a human decides.

88
00:06:58,740 --> 00:07:03,292
Now the part most demos hide: partial failure. We report a fresh incident on camera,

89
00:07:03,342 --> 00:07:07,895
