100
00:07:53,485 --> 00:07:57,423
of ten steps complete, every event in the ledger. Partial completion is the danger

101
00:07:57,473 --> 00:08:01,411
in infrastructure recovery; this platform treats it as a first-class case, not an

102
00:08:01,461 --> 00:08:05,399
